  "title": "Frontier Nuclear Nears Maiden Mineral Resource Estimate at Engo Valley as U.S. Accelerates Nuclear Fuel Cycle Strategy",
  "summary": "Winnipeg, Manitoba–(Newsfile Corp. – May 18, 2026) – Frontier Nuclear and Minerals Inc. (NASDAQ: FNUC) (“Frontier“), a nuclear fuel cycle company, provides an update on its Engo Valley uranium project (“Engo Valley“) in Namibia, the world’s third largest uranium producing country. Frontier is on track to issue its maiden mineral resource estimate for Engo Valley […]",
